OL,3,GNEWSAHow is a #2 cap on bus fares
OL,4,Aworking in the Highlands and islands?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBus passengers in the west of Scotland
OL,7,Fcan look forward to a #2 cap on their
OL,8,Ffares from Monday, but public transport
OL,9,Fusers in the Highlands and islands have
OL,10,Fbeen enjoying similar cut-price travel
OL,11,Ffor several months.
OL,13,FThe price cap is already in place in
OL,14,Fsix local authority areas under a
OL,15,Fyear-long trial.
OL,17,FCouncils involved say it has been a
OL,18,Fsuccess, but campaigners argue the real
OL,19,Fproblem is not cost but a lack of bus
OL,20,Fservices.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
