OL,3,GNEWSAHow is a #2 cap on bus fares
OL,4,Aworking in the Highlands and islands?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government has pledged to
OL,7,Fcut the cost of bus travel to #2 per
OL,8,Fsingle fare for every journey in the
OL,9,Fcountry by the end of this
OL,10,Fparliamentary term.
